## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check
npm run lint
```

Confirm: Back only in header; Overview shows `ImageCarousel` first in the left column when images exist; each editable card uses hover icon-only Edit3; card Edit opens the shared wizard at the mapped step; list Add uses the same dialog without `id`; after save, detail refreshes; section tabs sync via `?tab=` (default omitted from URL).
